09388","skill":"paper-trial","tex":"\\left\\lfloor \\frac{3646 \\cdot 8757}{10000} \\right\\rfloor = 3192 \\quad\\land\\quad 3100 < 3192 \\quad\\land\\quad 3192 < 3560 \\quad\\land\\quad 364 < 3100","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#x230A;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>3646</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8757</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>10000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#x230B;</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3192</mn></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mn>3100</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3192</mn></mrow></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mn>3192</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3560</mn></mrow></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mn>364</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3100</mn></mrow></mrow></math>","exercise":null},{"key":"mombh_quantum_hbeta_hgamma_are_balmer_lines","name":"QUANTUM: Hβ 1/4−1/16=3/16 → 12398·16/(3·13.6): 12398·160 − 4860·408 = 800 (<0.05%). Hγ 1/4−1/25=21/100 → 12398·100/(13.6·21): 12398·1000 − 4339·136·21 = 5816 (<0.05%). The absorbed lines are Rydberg differences with n=2 as the lower level.","why":"QUANTUM: Hβ 1/4−1/16=3/16 → 12398·16/(3·13.6): 12398·160 − 4860·408 = 800 (<0.05%). Hγ 1/4−1/25=21/100 → 12398·100/(13.6·21): 12398·1000 − 4339·136·21 = 5816 (<0.05%). The absorbed lines are Rydberg differences with n=2 as the lower level.","statement":"(12398 * 160 - 4860 * 408 = 800) ∧ (800 < 1000) ∧ (12398 * 1000 - 4339 * 136 * 21 = 5816) ∧ (5816 < 12398)","address":"96aacea5-ee30-871e-ba1c-6094589ba699","skill":"paper-trial","tex":"12398 \\cdot 160 - 4860 \\cdot 408 = 800 \\quad\\land\\quad 800 < 1000 \\quad\\land\\quad 12398 \\cdot 1000 - 4339 \\cdot 136 \\cdot 21 = 5816 \\quad\\land\\quad 5816 < 12398","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>12398</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>160</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>4860</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>408</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>800</mn></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mn>800</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>12398</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4339</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>136</mn></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5816</mn></mrow></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mn>5816</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>12398</mn></mrow></mrow></math>","exercise":{"kind":"predict-the-value","at":84,"length":4}}],"exercises":3}
